\documentclass[11pt]{article}
\usepackage[margin=1in]{geometry}

\title{Weekend Ridership on the Riverside Ferry: Preliminary Notes}
\author{T.~Lindqvist}
\date{November 2025}

\begin{document}
\maketitle

\section{Overview}
The Riverside Ferry links the market square with the botanical garden landing.
Weekend service runs every twenty minutes between nine in the morning and dusk.
The pilot has been funded by the city mobility office since May 2025.

\section{Ridership}
Ticket machines recieve a firmware update every Monday.
Saturday boardings averaged 1,180 per day over the first six months.
Sunday boardings were lighter at 940 per day.
The garden landing accounts for nearly two thirds of weekend traffic.

\section{Operations}
Two vessels alternate on the crossing, with a third held in reserve.
Crews report that boarding takes longest when the market lets out at noon.
A mid-river pontoon allows one vessel to berth during bridge maintenance.
\end{document}
